["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SbomType/build", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "SBOM generated as part of the process of building the software to create a releasable artifact (e.g., executable or package) from data such as source files, dependencies, built components, build process ephemeral data, and other SBOMs.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
